# Serve the built PHONO SPA. Railway injects $PORT; bind it (no TLS here —
# Railway terminates HTTPS at its edge). The app is a single index.html with
# an in-app nav stack (no server routes), so every path falls back to it.
#
# No CSP/security headers are set here on purpose: the player injects its own
# strict Content-Security-Policy as a <meta http-equiv> at build time (a Vite
# plugin), so the policy travels with the HTML on any static host. See the
# player's src/app/security/.
:{$PORT} {
	root * /srv
	encode gzip zstd

	# Long-cache Vite's content-hashed assets; never cache the HTML shell so a
	# redeploy is picked up immediately.
	@immutable path /assets/*
	header @immutable Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
	header /index.html Cache-Control "no-cache"

	try_files {path} /index.html
	file_server
}
